{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 34, :comments ["<b>In order that you may dwell in the land of Goshen.</b> And you need it, for it is pastureland, and when you tell him that you are skilled in no other trade, he will distance you from himself and settle you there." "<b>For every shepherd of sheep is an abomination to the Egyptians.</b> Because they are to them as deities."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 46, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:03:43.579208078Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}